        "en": "**The app cannot check this part.** For the writing, please use pen and paper. For the speaking, say it out loud and, if you can, practise with a native speaker or a teacher who can correct you.\n\n**Write (30–40 words).** Write a list of what there is in your classroom or on your desk, and five things a teacher often says.\n\n**Speak (about 30 seconds).** Say aloud five things you can say in class when you do not understand, need help or want something repeated."
